{"title":"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a> problems and solutions by year:\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> Until 2003 there was no Provincial competition for 1st grade students. There was only <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a>. Also, until 2003 2nd and 3rd grade papers were the same but each district capital had its own different paper. As of 2004 every district capital has the same paper but each grade (1st, 2nd, 3rd) has its own different paper.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"2004 Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">2004 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">2005 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a>, see also <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2007 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2009 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2010 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2011 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2012 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2013 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2014 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2015 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2016 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Cyprus Seniors Provincial (page does not exist)\">2017 Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Cyprus mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018022114\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4244:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018022114 and revision id 87388. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}